{
  "name": "A Day in the Field",
  "parents": [],
  "max-occurrences": 1,
  "triggers": [
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:random",
      "rarity": 1000000
    },
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:state",
      "state": {
        "path": "buildingManager/buildings",
        "match": {
          "type": "minecolonies:enchanter",
          "level": 2
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:citizen",
      "state": {
        "match": {
          "job": {
            "type": "minecolonies:enchanter"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "objectives": [
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:dialogue",
      "target": 0,
      "text": "Ah, perfect timing! I have been planning a field expedition with our university scholars to gather some rare medicinal herbs - there is a wonderful spot I know of not far from here. The trip out is easy enough, but I worry about getting everyone safely home before nightfall. The forest paths can be treacherous in the dark! I want to craft a Group Teleport Scroll to bring everyone home at once, but I am afraid I have used up all of my Teleport Scrolls on other projects. Could you bring me three?",
      "options": [
        {
          "answer": "Three scrolls? I can manage that!",
          "result": {
            "type": "minecolonies:advanceobjective",
            "go-to": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "answer": "That is a lot of scrolls, I am afraid I cannot spare them.",
          "result": {
            "type": "minecolonies:cancel"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:delivery",
      "details": {
        "target": 0,
        "item": "minecolonies:scroll_tp",
        "qty": 3,
        "next-objective": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:dialogue",
      "target": 0,
      "text": "Wonderful! This is everything I need. I will get the Group Scroll crafted and then we are off! The scholars are already beside themselves with excitement - they have been chattering about the trip all week. Come find me tomorrow and I will show you what we gathered. Hopefully it will be worth the journey!",
      "options": [
        {
          "answer": "I hope you find what you are looking for! I will check in tomorrow.",
          "result": {
            "type": "minecolonies:advanceobjective",
            "go-to": 3
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "unlocks-rewards": [
        0,
        1,
        2
      ],
      "type": "minecolonies:dialogue",
      "target": 0,
      "text": "You are back! Oh, what a day we had! The scholars found twice what I had hoped for - torchflower, orchid, all manner of remarkable specimens! Everyone was safe home before supper thanks to the scroll, which worked perfectly, I am pleased to say. Here, I had a spare scroll from the expedition and I want you to have it along with your scrolls back - you made this whole trip possible. Thank you!",
      "options": [
        {
          "answer": "It sounds like it was a wonderful success! I am glad I could help.",
          "result": {
            "type": "minecolonies:advanceobjective",
            "go-to": 4
          }
        },
        {
          "answer": "Tell me more about what you found!",
          "result": {
            "type": "minecolonies:dialogue",
            "text": "Oh where to even begin! There was a cluster of torchflower growing right alongside a patch of orchids, which I have never seen before. The scholars were absolutely buzzing. I could talk about it all day, but you should take your reward first! We must do this again sometime.",
            "options": [
              {
                "answer": "That sounds incredible. Thank you!",
                "result": {
                  "type": "minecolonies:advanceobjective",
                  "go-to": 4
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "rewards": [
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:item",
      "details": {
        "item": "minecolonies:scroll_area_tp",
        "qty": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:item",
      "details": {
        "item": "minecolonies:scroll_tp",
        "qty": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:item",
      "details": {
        "item": "minecraft:blue_orchid",
        "qty": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:happiness",
      "details": {
        "target": 0,
        "qty": 1,
        "days": 7
      }
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "Ancient Magic",
  "parents": [],
  "max-occurrences": 1,
  "triggers": [
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:random",
      "rarity": 2500000
    },
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:state",
      "state": {
        "path": "buildingManager/buildings",
        "match": {
          "type": "minecolonies:hospital",
          "level": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:citizen",
      "state": {
        "match": {
          "job": {
            "type": "minecolonies:enchanter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:citizen",
      "state": {
        "match": {
          "job": {
            "type": "minecolonies:healer"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "objectives": [
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:dialogue",
      "target": 0,
      "text": "Oh! Something extraordinary is happening - my crystals have been absolutely singing since you walked in. There is an ancient, powerful magic nearby... something I have never encountered before in person. Have you by chance come across a Sacred Scroll of Regeneration in your travels? Old parchment, warm to the touch, a faint smell of lavender? This magic was thought lost to time - I cannot even begin to understand how to recreate it. Our doctor has been utterly overwhelmed lately with a terrible strain of flu going through the colony. If you have such a scroll, please - take it to $1 at once. It could change everything.",
      "options": [
        {
          "answer": "I think I do have something like that...",
          "result": {
            "type": "minecolonies:advanceobjective",
            "go-to": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "answer": "I have not come across anything like that yet.",
          "result": {
            "type": "minecolonies:return"
          }
        },
        {
          "answer": "I am afraid I cannot help with this.",
          "result": {
            "type": "minecolonies:cancel"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:delivery",
      "details": {
        "target": 1,
        "item": "minecolonies:scroll_buff",
        "qty": 1,
        "next-objective": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "unlocks-rewards": [
        0,
        1,
        2,
        3
      ],
      "type": "minecolonies:dialogue",
      "target": 1,
      "text": "Oh... oh my. Is this...? I have read about these but never... I could weep. Do you have any idea what this means? Every patient I have been struggling with this week - this changes everything. I am going to use this immediately. I know I cannot replace something this rare - there is no substitute for ancient magic like this. But please, take these. They are not much compared to what you have given this colony today, but they come from the heart.",
      "options": [
        {
          "answer": "I hope everyone recovers quickly. You are doing wonderful work.",
          "result": {
            "type": "minecolonies:advanceobjective",
            "go-to": 3
          }
        },
        {
          "answer": "Is there anything else I can do to help?",
          "result": {
            "type": "minecolonies:dialogue",
            "text": "Just knowing that people like you are out there looking after us is enough. Now go on - you have done more than enough today. Thank you. Truly, from the bottom of my heart.",
            "options": [
              {
                "answer": "Take good care of them. Thank you!",
                "result": {
                  "type": "minecolonies:advanceobjective",
                  "go-to": 3
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "rewards": [
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:item",
      "details": {
        "item": "minecraft:potion",
        "qty": 1,
        "nbt": "{Potion:\"minecraft:luck\"}"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:item",
      "details": {
        "item": "minecraft:potion",
        "qty": 1,
        "nbt": "{Potion:\"minecraft:luck\"}"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:item",
      "details": {
        "item": "minecraft:potion",
        "qty": 1,
        "nbt": "{Potion:\"minecraft:luck\"}"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:happiness",
      "details": {
        "target": 1,
        "qty": 2,
        "days": 14
      }
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "A Promise to Keep",
  "parents": [],
  "max-occurrences": 1,
  "triggers": [
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:random",
      "rarity": 1000000
    },
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:state",
      "state": {
        "path": "buildingManager/buildings",
        "match": {
          "type": "minecolonies:enchanter",
          "level": 1
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:citizen",
      "state": {
        "match": {
          "job": {
            "type": "minecolonies:enchanter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:citizen",
      "state": {
        "match": {
          "job": {
            "type": "minecolonies:knight"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "objectives": [
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:dialogue",
      "target": 0,
      "text": "Oh, I am glad you stopped by! One of our guards came to me with a bit of a dilemma - they need to make a trip to a nearby village to visit family, but they have a patrol shift tonight and do not want to leave the colony unprotected. I told them I could craft a Teleport Scroll to make the trip quick enough that they could be back in time. I just need a few materials - could you help?",
      "options": [
        {
          "answer": "Of course! What do you need?",
          "result": {
            "type": "minecolonies:dialogue",
            "text": "Wonderful! Just three sheets of paper and a compass - I already have the Build Tool ready here. Simple enough! Once I have those I can have the scroll finished in no time.",
            "options": [
              {
                "answer": "I will get those for you right away!",
                "result": {
                  "type": "minecolonies:advanceobjective",
                  "go-to": 1
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "answer": "Sorry, I am a bit busy right now.",
          "result": {
            "type": "minecolonies:cancel"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:delivery",
      "details": {
        "target": 0,
        "item": "minecraft:paper",
        "qty": 3,
        "next-objective": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:delivery",
      "details": {
        "target": 0,
        "item": "minecraft:compass",
        "qty": 1,
        "next-objective": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:dialogue",
      "target": 0,
      "text": "Perfect! The scroll is already done - the guard stopped by a little while ago so I sent it along with them straight away. They are out on the paths somewhere. Why don't you go say hello? I am sure they would appreciate knowing you helped make this possible!",
      "options": [
        {
          "answer": "Happy to! I will go find them.",
          "result": {
            "type": "minecolonies:advanceobjective",
            "go-to": 4
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "unlocks-rewards": [
        0,
        1,
        2
      ],
      "type": "minecolonies:dialogue",
      "target": 1,
      "text": "Oh! You must be the one who helped the enchanter gather those materials! I heard all about it. I actually have some great news - one of the other guards offered to cover my shift so I could stay the night after all! I am still taking the scroll just in case. My mother absolutely insisted I bring this back for whoever helped. She baked it fresh this morning!",
      "options": [
        {
          "answer": "Give your family my best! Safe travels!",
          "result": {
            "type": "minecolonies:advanceobjective",
            "go-to": 5
          }
        },
        {
          "answer": "That is very kind! Tell her it smells wonderful.",
          "result": {
            "type": "minecolonies:dialogue",
            "text": "Ha! I will pass that along. She will be so pleased. Now go on - and thank you again, truly. It means a lot that people here look out for one another.",
            "options": [
              {
                "answer": "That is what a good colony is all about!",
                "result": {
                  "type": "minecolonies:advanceobjective",
                  "go-to": 5
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "rewards": [
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:item",
      "details": {
        "item": "minecolonies:scroll_tp",
        "qty": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:item",
      "details": {
        "item": "minecraft:pumpkin_pie",
        "qty": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:happiness",
      "details": {
        "target": 1,
        "qty": 1,
        "days": 7
      }
    }
  ]
}

{
  "name": "Things That Go Bump in the Night",
  "parents": [],
  "max-occurrences": 1,
  "triggers": [
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:random",
      "rarity": 1000000
    },
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:state",
      "state": {
        "path": "buildingManager/buildings",
        "match": {
          "type": "minecolonies:enchanter",
          "level": 2
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:citizen",
      "state": {
        "match": {
          "job": {
            "type": "minecolonies:enchanter"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "objectives": [
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:dialogue",
      "target": 0,
      "text": "Oh! I am so glad you stopped by. I have been hearing the most unsettling noises near the tower at night - rustling, thumping, all manner of things. Could be animals. Could be something worse. I would feel much safer if I had a Spatial Guard Reinforcements Scroll on hand, just in case. Could you help me gather the ingredients?",
      "options": [
        {
          "answer": "Of course! What do you need?",
          "result": {
            "type": "minecolonies:dialogue",
            "text": "Wonderful, thank you! I will need one Teleport Scroll, five Lapis Lazuli, one Ender Pearl, and one sheet of Paper. I have the enchanting setup ready - I just need the raw materials. Once I have them I can get to work tonight.",
            "options": [
              {
                "answer": "Leave it to me, I will gather those right away!",
                "result": {
                  "type": "minecolonies:advanceobjective",
                  "go-to": 1
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "answer": "Sorry, I am a bit busy right now.",
          "result": {
            "type": "minecolonies:cancel"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:delivery",
      "details": {
        "target": 0,
        "item": "minecolonies:scroll_tp",
        "qty": 1,
        "next-objective": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:delivery",
      "details": {
        "target": 0,
        "item": "minecraft:lapis_lazuli",
        "qty": 5,
        "next-objective": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:delivery",
      "details": {
        "target": 0,
        "item": "minecraft:ender_pearl",
        "qty": 1,
        "next-objective": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:delivery",
      "details": {
        "target": 0,
        "item": "minecraft:paper",
        "qty": 1,
        "next-objective": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:dialogue",
      "target": 0,
      "text": "Perfect! This is everything I need. I will get to work on the scroll tonight and have a proper listen around the tower while I am at it. Come back and check in with me tomorrow - I will let you know what I found!",
      "options": [
        {
          "answer": "Of course! I will stop by tomorrow.",
          "result": {
            "type": "minecolonies:advanceobjective",
            "go-to": 6
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "unlocks-rewards": [
        0,
        1,
        2,
        3,
        4
      ],
      "type": "minecolonies:dialogue",
      "target": 0,
      "text": "Oh! You are back! Ha - you will not believe this. I stayed up half the night, peered out every window, and do you know what was making all that noise? Squirrels! A whole family of squirrels had made a nest in the woodpile outside. Completely harmless. I feel a little foolish, I will admit. The good news is I used the time productively and made not one but three scrolls! Here, take them - and the leftover materials. Thank you for humoring a nervous enchanter.",
      "options": [
        {
          "answer": "Ha! I am glad it was not something worse. Stay safe!",
          "result": {
            "type": "minecolonies:advanceobjective",
            "go-to": 7
          }
        },
        {
          "answer": "Three scrolls? You really went all out!",
          "result": {
            "type": "minecolonies:dialogue",
            "text": "Well, I had to do something with all that nervous energy! Besides, you never know when guards might come in handy. Now go on, and do not hesitate to visit if you need more enchanting work done.",
            "options": [
              {
                "answer": "Will do. Thanks!",
                "result": {
                  "type": "minecolonies:advanceobjective",
                  "go-to": 7
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "rewards": [
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:item",
      "details": {
        "item": "minecolonies:scroll_guard_help",
        "qty": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:item",
      "details": {
        "item": "minecraft:lapis_lazuli",
        "qty": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:item",
      "details": {
        "item": "minecraft:ender_pearl",
        "qty": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:item",
      "details": {
        "item": "minecraft:paper",
        "qty": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "minecolonies:happiness",
      "details": {
        "target": 0,
        "qty": 1,
        "days": 7
      }
    }
  ]
}

{
  "type": "minecolonies:dialogue",
  "target": 0,
  "text": "Oh, come in, come in! I could not help but overhear the tavernkeeper going on again - apparently the builder has gone missing mid-job and the tavern awning still needs patching. I feel terrible for both of them, honestly. I thought I might help by crafting a Worker-Where-Are-You Scroll - it would highlight the builder so we could find them in no time! Would you be able to gather the ingredients for me?",
  "options": [
    {
      "answer": "Happy to help! What do you need?",
      "result": {
        "type": "minecolonies:dialogue",
        "text": "Wonderful! I will need three Teleport Scrolls, six Glowstone Dust, and two sheets of Paper. A bit involved, but worth it to settle this whole business once and for all, I think!",
        "options": [
          {
            "answer": "I will get those gathered up!",
            "result": {
              "type": "minecolonies:advanceobjective",
              "go-to": 1
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "answer": "I think this is between them, I am staying out of it.",
      "result": {
        "type": "minecolonies:cancel"
      }
    }
  ]
}

{
  "type": "minecolonies:dialogue",
  "target": 0,
  "text": "Excellent! I am working on the scroll now - these things take a little time to get right. Come check in with me when you are ready and I will have it finished!",
  "options": [
    {
      "answer": "Take your time, I will check back soon!",
      "result": {
        "type": "minecolonies:return"
      }
    },
    {
      "answer": "I am back - is the scroll ready?",
      "result": {
        "type": "minecolonies:advanceobjective",
        "go-to": 5
      }
    }
  ]
}

{
  "type": "minecolonies:dialogue",
  "target": 0,
  "text": "Ah, perfect timing! The scroll is done. Let me just... [holds up the scroll and closes their eyes] ...there! It is done. Your builder should have a subtle glow about them now - they will not even notice. Go find them and see what they are up to. I will be here when you get back!",
  "options": [
    {
      "answer": "On it! I will report back.",
      "result": {
        "type": "minecolonies:advanceobjective",
        "go-to": 6
      }
    }
  ]
}

{
  "type": "minecolonies:dialogue",
  "target": 1,
  "text": "Oh! Oh no. You found me. Please, please - you have to keep this quiet! I have been sneaking down to the warehouse basement between tasks. It is the only place in the entire colony where I can get five minutes of peace without someone nagging me about something. I KNOW about the tavernkeeper's awning, I have not forgotten, I promise. I just needed a moment to breathe. You understand, yes? Please give my thanks to the enchanter - they are very kind. But keep this between us, would you?",
  "options": [
    {
      "answer": "Your secret is safe with me. Get some rest!",
      "result": {
        "type": "minecolonies:advanceobjective",
        "go-to": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "answer": "I completely understand. I will not say a word.",
      "result": {
        "type": "minecolonies:dialogue",
        "text": "Bless you! I will get to the awning first thing tomorrow, I swear it. Now if you do not mind, I still have about ten minutes left in my nap. Thank you, truly.",
        "options": [
          {
            "answer": "Sweet dreams. You have earned it!",
            "result": {
              "type": "minecolonies:advanceobjective",
              "go-to": 7
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}

{
  "unlocks-rewards": [
    0,
    1,
    2,
    3,
    4,
    5
  ],
  "type": "minecolonies:dialogue",
  "target": 0,
  "text": "Ha! Hiding in the warehouse basement! That is... honestly, I cannot even blame them. The tavernkeeper has been relentless this week. Well, we found them, and I am sure the awning will get sorted out eventually. Here - take these scrolls and your materials back. You did a good deed today, even if it was mostly for everyone's sanity!",
  "options": [
    {
      "answer": "I think we have all needed a quiet corner at some point.",
      "result": {
        "type": "minecolonies:advanceobjective",
        "go-to": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "answer": "Let us hope the tavernkeeper does not find the basement.",
      "result": {
        "type": "minecolonies:dialogue",
        "text": "Ha! Oh they will eventually. But that is a problem for another day. Take your reward - you have earned it. And thank you for keeping this between us!",
        "options": [
          {
            "answer": "Always. Thanks!",
            "result": {
              "type": "minecolonies:advanceobjective",
              "go-to": 8
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
